      "review_summary": "The branch adds typed Google auth credential resolution and public CLI backend auth-profile forwarding, changes Gemini CLI auth staging to OAuth-only, updates Google setup/docs, and adds focused tests plus a deterministic proof script.\n\nPR surface: Source +237, Tests +410, Docs +49, Generated 0, Other +126. Total +822 across 22 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. Source inspection of current main versus PR head shows the bundled-MCP startup failure path changes from throwing to warning and continuing, and the cleanup guard no longer covers reference lookup or other mid-prepare failures; I did not run tests in this read-only review.",
